Description: GitHub tray app for Linux
 RepoBar is a system-tray app that surfaces GitHub repositories,
 issues, pull requests, releases, and CI state in a single popup
 menu. It ships with a CLI (`repobar`) that exposes the same data
 surfaces for scripting and a GTK3 tray (`RepoBarGtk`) that
 publishes a StatusNotifierItem via libayatana-appindicator3.
 .
 The .deb bundles a self-contained Swift runtime
 (--static-swift-stdlib) so no Swift toolchain is required at
 runtime — only standard GUI libraries from the base Ubuntu install.
